<title>SWITZERLAND: Agie Charmilles details first results.</title>
<headline>Agie Charmilles details first results.</headline>
<dateline>ZUG, Switzerland 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 financial results including 12 months of Agie group but only fourth quarter of Charmilles group. The companies merged in October 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of Swiss francs)</p>
<p> Group net     23.1</p>
<p> Turnover     464.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Agie Charmilles, the leading company in spark erosion machinery, was formed by the merger of Agie Holding AG with Georg Fischer AG's Charmilles unit. On a consolidated pro-forma basis, full-year 1996 sales were 816.1 million, operating profit 52.3 million and group net 33.4 million, it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
